      "content": "I understand the concerns and acknowledge that the traditional human-in-the-loop approach is not without risk. After reevaluating the sensitivity analysis, I'm willing to concede that the risk of an under-controlled collision cannot be entirely mitigated by manual approval. Therefore, I'm recommending a relocation of our safety targets and a revision of my overhaul structure to address the uncertainty introduced by the manual override process. This will likely require careful recalibration of my hazard detection thresholds to account for human delay and varying touchscreens.",
